flowchart TD
    NEED["a background need"] --> CLASSIFY{what kind?}
    CLASSIFY -->|deferrable work| WM["WorkManager + constraints (Ch 30)"]
    CLASSIFY -->|ongoing user-visible| FGS["Foreground service (Ch 46)"]
    CLASSIFY -->|prompt wake, time-sensitive| FCM["High-priority FCM (Ch 49)"]
    CLASSIFY -->|genuine user-facing time| ALARM["Exact alarm (Ch 48)"]
    WM --> OSGOV["OS governs: Doze windows + App Standby bucket"]
    FCM --> OSGOV
    ALARM --> OSGOV
    OSGOV --> OEM{aggressive OEM?}
    OEM -->|yes| GUIDE["guide user: disable battery optimization / FGS for critical path"]
    OEM -->|no| RUN["runs in maintenance window"]
    RUN --> DEGRADE["degrade gracefully: catch-up sync, backoff, idempotent (Ch 32/15)"]
